  "description": "Just a quick 3 minute update...",
  "body_html": "<p>Selling off TMC The Metals Company, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$TMC&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> for ~20% gain. This was a simply hype play, and I made it clear in the original post, <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/high-risk-high-reward-stock-buy\">High Risk High Reward</a>, I was not in love with it. It had a nice break upwards the last week, and not something I want to hold forever. It could very well reverse and trend back up…but its just not for me any longer. It spiked up past +40% profit during that time, but I do not like the structure any longer. </p><p>Other positions I am continuing to hold. Watch the video for more information. </p><p>If you have questions, feel free to ping me in <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/f3a6e152-6d8d-4bb2-9d88-be95c227fb0e\">the chat</a></p><p>And you can check out <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">the StockTok Summary</a> page for current positions and all of the pre-screened stocks that meet buying criteria.</p><p>Once we get a clear “statement” candle form the VIX and the S&amp;P 500, I am sure we will have more positions to play…but right now I am hesitant to get heavily involved with the market. </p><p>Have a great day, and thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
